Fatal Falling Material Accident<br>
November 10, 2006
<br><br>

Seppi Brothers Concrete Products Corporation<br>
Jammer Lake Pit - Virginia<br>
Virginia, St. Louis County, Minnesota<br>
Mine I.D. No. 21-00880
<br><br>


Investigators

<br><br>
